{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47028","headline":"还人卷 · 齐己","name":"还人卷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"李白李贺遗机杼，散在人间不知处。\n闻君收在芙蓉江，日鬬鲛人织秋浦。\n金梭劄劄文离离，吴姬越女羞上机。\n鸳鸯浴烟鸾凤飞，澄江晓映余霞辉。\n仙人手持玉刀尺，寸寸酬君珠与璧。\n裁作霞裳何处披，紫皇殿里深难觅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}